1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,573
Finally, in Module 6, we cover the administrator setup of the Tiny A I Assistant itself.

2
00:00:07,573 --> 00:00:11,941
Tiny is powered by a dedicated Claude Project workspace.

3
00:00:11,941 --> 00:00:20,441
To build this capability, an administrator first creates a new project and uploads the static Octane knowledge base.

4
00:00:20,441 --> 00:00:28,823
This includes our proprietary Service Catalog, key Competitor Profiles, Case Studies, and Pricing Frameworks.

5
00:00:28,823 --> 00:00:37,573
Once the context files are uploaded, the administrator configures the custom instructions, embedding the 'Mega-Prompt' logic.

6
00:00:37,573 --> 00:00:51,749
This forces the A I to output the strict ten-point prep dossier and the six standardized sales reports, ensuring consistent, enterprise-grade output from the sales team on every single deal.

